ordering on strings).
For any such $a$ define the multilinear polynomial $g_a: \F_q^m \to \F_q$,
called the \emph{low-degree encoding of $a$}, as follows:
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:ld-encoding}
	 g_a(x) = \sum_{y \in \{0,1\}^m} a_y \cdot \ind_{m,y}(x)\;.
